{"ref":"BDB, צָלִי","hw":"צָלִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צָלִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.</strong> et <strong>n.m. roasted, roast</strong>;—cstr. (as adj.) <span dir=\"rtl\">צְלִי־אֵשׁ</span> (P) of flesh <span dir=\"rtl\">(בָּשָׂר)</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:8\" href=\"/Exodus.12.8\">Ex 12:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:9\" href=\"/Exodus.12.9\">9</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְבֻשָּׁל בַּמָּ֑יִם</span>); abs. as subst. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.16\">Is 44:16</a> v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, צָלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_צָלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">צָלָה</a>].","next":"BDB, צָלַח","prev":"BDB, צָלָה"}